{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4q9dFGzN_jVONhNCwWhHZw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:06.313147+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4q9dFGzN_jVONhNCwWhHZw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OsGaOFhR0Hrryx6YfEEKtcmiaMiaJJ1G7fec3uCzVpxTmNLNk3DGCEJ26hmguQ2llG1jUnRnezDj9UjlA8CskIuA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>活动通知</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为进一步增进优秀本科生对中南财经政法大学发展历程、丰硕成果和良好的校园文化的了解，激发优秀学子对相关专业学习和研究的兴趣，中南财经政法大学会计学院特举办2025年“会人会语”优秀本科生研招校园开放日研学活动。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德优良，在校期间没有受过任何纪律处分。</span></p><p><span>（二）有机会获得本科就读学校的2026届推免生资格。</span></p><p><span>（三）刻苦学习，勤于思考，有创新意识和科研潜力，学习成绩优秀，专业成绩和综合成绩均名列本专业前列。</span></p><p><span>（四）有较强的独立调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></p><p><span>（五）熟练掌握英语，并至少满足以下任一项条件：国家大学英语六级水平考试成绩430分以上；英语专业的专业四级成绩良好以上；学术类雅思成绩6.5分以上；托福成绩80分以上。</span></p><p><span>（六）有下列情形之一者，同等条件下优先：</span></p><p><span>1.公开发表高水平学术论文或公开出版学术专著。</span></p><p><span>2.参加社会实践并写出具有重要价值的调查报告。</span></p><p><span>3.参加专业领域全国学术活动并获奖。</span></p><p><span>4.作为学校优秀学生派出国外、境外知名大学学习1年以上。</span></p><p><span>（七）遵守学术道德规范。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>网上报名方式和时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>凡申请参加本校园开放日研学活动的学生，须于2025年7月20日8点-8月10日17点之间进入我校“2025年优秀本科生研招校园开放日研学活动在线报名系统”（https://yzb.zuel.edu.cn/2017/0420/c4641a156321/page.htm）进行报名，如实填写个人信息。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>01</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>直博生</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>如意向交流的类别为“直接攻读博士学位研究生”（下称“直博生”），请在系统中选择“会计学（直博）”“财务管理（直博）”“审计学（直博）”专业报名</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>02</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学术学位硕士</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>如意向交流的类别为学术学位硕士，请在系统中选择“会计学”“财务管理”“审计学”专业报名</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>03</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span><span>专业学位硕士</span></span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>如意向</span><span>交流的</span><span>类别为专业学位硕士，请在系统中选择“会计（专业学位）”报名</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>每人限报一个专业。开放日活动中（院情介绍与专业解读环节后），将提供报名类别与专业的调整机会。</span></strong></p><p><span>申请人在网上提交的信息必须准确、有效，凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实，将取消申请资格。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>提交电子材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（一）有效居民身份证（正反面）。</span></p><p><span>（二）申请表1份，从报名系统中导出。</span></p><p><span>（三）专家推荐信（附件1）2份，由两名具有高级职称的教师推荐。</span></p><p><span>（四）本科阶段前六学期成绩单、学分绩点、专业年级排名和专业年级总人数证明材料各一份，由学校教务部门或院系盖章。</span></p><p><span>（五）大学英语六级成绩单或证书；或英语专业的专业考试成绩单；或学术类雅思成绩单；或托福成绩单。上述成绩单申请者可同时提供。</span></p><p><span>（六）大学阶段获奖证书每证1份。</span></p><p><span>（七）反映其科研能力或科研潜力或专业实践能力的成果1份。</span></p><p><strong><span>申请直博同学需另外提供：</span></strong></p><p><span>（八）个人陈述1份。</span></p><p><span>（九）研究计划书1份。</span></p><p><span>申请参加本校园开放日研学活动的同学须将所有材料的原件扫描后按上述顺序汇总至一个PDF文档中，于2025年8月10日17:00前发至QQ邮箱：zuel-accounting@qq.com，建议用QQ邮箱发送，邮件主题：2025“会人会语”开放日；文件命名格式：本科学校名称-申请专业（此处仅需填写“专硕”、“学硕”或“直博”）-姓名，逾期将不再接收申请材料。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>资格审核</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院组织专家对提交的材料进行审核，资格审核通过的学生名单将于2025年8月20日前在会计学院官网进行公布。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（一）活动时间：2025年8月29日-8月31日，其中2025年8月29日下午报到。</span></p><p><span>（二）活动地点：中南财经政法大学南湖校区。</span></p><p><span>（三）活动内容：学院介绍、专业解读、研学活动、学术能力和专业实践能力评价等。</span><span>政治思想品德活动不作量化，但对发现问题者实行“一票否决”。</span></p><p><span>（四）特别说明：</span></p><p><span>1.有意参加校园开放日的同学，必须按照上述要求，正式报名。入选后，需按要求全程参加校园开放日研学活动。</span></p><p><span>2.校园开放日研学活动机会宝贵，名额有限，若入选不能参加者请及时告知我院。</span></p><p><span>3.本次校园开放日研学活动不收取任何费用。</span></p><p><span>4.对完整参加校园开放日研学活动并高质量完成研学活动的学员，学院将确定研学结果并予以公示。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>中南财经政法大学研究生招生网：http://yzb.zuel.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span>中南财经政法大学会计学院：http://kjxy.zuel.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OsGaOFhR0Hrryx6YfEEKtcmiaMiaJJ1G7fRUVibMWhliah6cHeQv4MQHHYrmy1yN3w4ITLmlvibInvVMHwVGTOO8xfQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>杭老师（直博和学硕）：027-88386514</span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：kjxy-zs@qq.com</span></span></p><p><span>张老师（专硕）：027-88387513 </span></p><p><span>邮箱：77251257@qq.com</span></p><p><span>暑假期间请加入QQ群咨询</span></p><p><span>QQ群号：832328826。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>点击“阅读原文”</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OsGaOFhR0Hrryx6YfEEKtcmiaMiaJJ1G7fyiaGhgPMbSYO0U2ztDOiaJNod2licPVBMbZJphBwMxHMbYKgxaPtcwFvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>获取附件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a4a263be14bb1d3af88bd69d7f605f556221898e6687bc04a6939fd8896fab79","textLength":1876,"sourceSha256":"f224ca8a48eacc3d3e3f2f0b32ca370e99e078b6ccadbc4feb2a25f3adaef60f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2ef9387d65f657c46a31","title":"2025年中南财经政法大学会计学院“会人会语”优秀本科生研招校园开放日研学活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:06.313147+00:00"}
